Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 16:51:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add client-side AI chatbot (signed-in users only)

- Add ChatBot floating widget component (components/chat/ChatBot.tsx)
- Wire to backend chatbot Edge Function via supabase.functions.invoke
- Extends useAuth to expose userId for booking context enrichment
- Renders only in signed-in layout; guest users do not see it
- Add chat types (ChatMessage, ChatBotProps) to types/index.ts
- Add chat widget CSS styles to styles.css

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
